WEBVTT

00:01.240 --> 00:03.600
<b>In the second decisive 
battle with the villains,</b>

00:03.600 --> 00:06.920
<b>the heroes were able to split up 
the villains according to plan</b>

00:07.350 --> 00:10.590
<b>and fight simultaneously in 
eight locations at once.</b>

00:11.490 --> 00:15.490
<b>Himiko Toga was sent to the 
outlying island, Okuto Island.</b>

00:16.010 --> 00:21.910
<b>Other villains were sent to Takoba 
National Stadium to contain the damage.</b>

00:22.540 --> 00:26.980
<b>The villains who were not split up 
were dealt with using System Troy.</b>

00:27.930 --> 00:30.600
<b>At the site of Jaku Hospital,</b>

00:30.600 --> 00:33.890
<b>there were those defending the 
facilities holding Gigantomachia.</b>

00:34.830 --> 00:40.590
<b>At Central Hospital, there was fighting 
to protect the imprisoned Kurogiri.</b>

00:41.930 --> 00:44.540
<b>At Ground Zero in Kamino Ward...</b>

00:48.150 --> 00:53.850
<b>In the end, I guess it was nice 
that I got to fight you first.</b>

00:53.850 --> 00:55.690
<b>Shoto, run away!</b>

00:57.530 --> 01:00.870
<b>It really is different if 
you feel it up close.</b>

01:00.870 --> 01:03.570
<b>You get the hang of it intuitively.</b>

01:04.700 --> 01:08.950
<b>Before the ice hit, I took a 
chance and tried to copy it.</b>

01:09.690 --> 01:14.800
<b>This is it, right, Shoto?</b>

01:15.680 --> 01:21.180
<b>Using the new Flashfire Todoroki 
created, Dabi made a comeback.</b>

01:21.960 --> 01:25.020
<b>And at the Gunga Villa site...</b>

01:27.780 --> 01:33.440
<b>Heroes are those who defend, while 
villains are those who violate.</b>

01:34.000 --> 01:38.320
<b>We push our way forward toward our dreams.</b>

01:40.900 --> 01:43.620
<b>Be proud, Endeavor.</b>

01:44.460 --> 01:49.330
<b>I didn't think I'd have to 
play this card against YOU.</b>

01:50.060 --> 01:57.320
<b>Using Eri's Quirk, All For One rewound 
and restored his physical body.</b>

01:58.700 --> 02:00.510
<b>Around that time,</b>

02:00.510 --> 02:03.920
<b>I was on my way from Okuto Island, where 
I'd been transported by Himiko Toga,</b>

02:04.570 --> 02:08.160
<b>to the Coffin in the Sky above U.A.</b>

03:40.580 --> 03:43.010
<b>I have to get to U.A. as soon as possible!</b>

03:43.010 --> 03:45.410
<b>But I can't go any faster!</b>

03:45.930 --> 03:46.970
<b>Midoriya.</b>

03:46.970 --> 03:49.160
<b>Oh, First! Yes?</b>

03:49.590 --> 03:52.220
<b>I've had a bad feeling for a while now.</b>

03:52.220 --> 03:53.260
<b>A bad feeling?</b>

03:53.730 --> 03:59.540
<b>Like my brother, All For One's 
Quirks have been increasing...</b>

04:02.840 --> 04:03.900
<b>That's...</b>

04:05.130 --> 04:09.610
<b>It's time for a school bus, friend of 
lost kids, to make an appearance.</b>

04:09.970 --> 04:11.260
<b>Grab hold, kid!</b>

04:13.870 --> 04:15.600
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

04:16.000 --> 04:21.650
<b>Jeez, I was supposed to be in 
U.A.'s anti-aircraft escort.</b>

04:21.650 --> 04:22.640
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

04:22.980 --> 04:24.220
<b>We're counting on you!</b>

04:24.990 --> 04:30.400
<b>In the first place, we're ignoring orders 
to retreat and staying in Japan.</b>

04:31.340 --> 04:32.870
<b>Do you know why?</b>

04:34.390 --> 04:38.510
<b>Because our li'l sis bet on you guys.</b>

04:40.210 --> 04:44.430
<b>If you're the one who inherited 
All Might's power,</b>

04:44.430 --> 04:47.190
<b>then use us and go!</b>

04:47.730 --> 04:51.370
<b>Go and defeat the worst villain in history!</b>

04:51.370 --> 04:52.260
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

05:03.110 --> 05:06.610
<b>It's peachy keen!</b>

05:13.110 --> 05:13.960
<b>Huh?</b>

05:20.320 --> 05:22.470
<b>Izuku Midoriya!</b>

05:30.860 --> 05:33.220
<b>He's gotten stronger than before...?</b>

05:34.760 --> 05:37.100
<b>That glowing energy...</b>

05:38.510 --> 05:39.830
<b>It's his...</b>

05:43.040 --> 05:43.930
<b>Mandalay!</b>

05:43.930 --> 05:45.220
<b>Reinstate the barrier!</b>

05:48.350 --> 05:51.380
<b>All right! We've got Midoriya back!</b>

05:51.790 --> 05:53.240
<b>Sorry I'm late!</b>

05:53.530 --> 05:54.990
<b>Is everyone all righ--</b>

06:26.430 --> 06:30.790
<b>Do you need to give your 
excuse for being late?</b>

06:31.660 --> 06:34.080
<b>Toga did something, didn't she?</b>

06:35.340 --> 06:37.420
<b>Izuku Midoriya.</b>

06:38.330 --> 06:40.200
<b>Why don't you say it?</b>

06:41.350 --> 06:43.430
<b>"It couldn't be helped."</b>

06:43.870 --> 06:47.040
<b>"I didn't expect it either."</b>

06:47.780 --> 06:55.760
<b>Why don't you avoid taking responsibility 
like those other guys?</b>

07:12.700 --> 07:14.560
<b>When he gets mad,</b>

07:15.690 --> 07:18.490
<b>his movements become extremely 
simple and predictable.</b>

07:19.500 --> 07:21.930
<b>I'll destroy his spine with a counter.</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:24.150
<b>Now, come!</b>

07:25.770 --> 07:28.840
<b>Are you happy with my present for you?</b>

07:30.870 --> 07:32.470
<b>It's all right, Deku!</b>

07:33.510 --> 07:34.970
<b>Him again...</b>

07:35.680 --> 07:37.900
<b>You can't forgive yourself, right?</b>

07:37.900 --> 07:39.390
<b>Yeah, I get it.</b>

07:39.800 --> 07:43.220
<b>But that's just how the 
villains want you to feel.</b>

07:43.500 --> 07:44.590
<b>It's all right!</b>

07:44.590 --> 07:47.060
<b>Tamaki and the others were still breathing!</b>

07:47.370 --> 07:52.010
<b>Edge Shot is taking action 
to save Bakugo's life!</b>

07:52.010 --> 07:54.610
<b>He'll definitely succeed!</b>

07:54.890 --> 07:57.380
<b>That's the assumption everyone 
is under as they fight!</b>

07:57.790 --> 08:01.370
<b>We haven't lost a single thing yet!</b>

08:01.740 --> 08:03.560
<b>We haven't given up!</b>

08:04.450 --> 08:10.870
<b>When you spout lip service like that, 
it's called running away from reality!</b>

08:11.150 --> 08:13.850
<b>We're heroes!</b>

08:13.850 --> 08:20.260
<b>If heroes don't say stuff like that, then 
who will make ideals into reality?!</b>

08:24.230 --> 08:26.920
<b>Lip service? That's just fine!</b>

08:27.430 --> 08:31.010
<b>We're the ones risking our 
lives to make that a reality!</b>

08:32.090 --> 08:35.860
<b>Because our li'l sis bet on you guys.</b>

08:37.310 --> 08:39.160
<b>It's fine to get mad.</b>

08:39.160 --> 08:41.500
<b>Anger is the source of power.</b>

08:42.050 --> 08:46.700
<b>But that's why you need to 
control it really carefully.</b>

08:48.380 --> 08:52.020
<b>What's important is controlling your heart.</b>

09:02.010 --> 09:05.000
<b>I'm sorry, Lemillion.</b>

09:05.000 --> 09:08.010
<b>Apologize after we've won, hero!</b>

09:11.990 --> 09:13.710
<b>All For One...</b>

09:18.520 --> 09:23.420
<b>Is Shigaraki... still in there?</b>

09:24.000 --> 09:28.000
<b>A Chain of Events, Across the Ages</b>

09:33.470 --> 09:36.300
<b>I was wondering what you'd say...</b>

09:36.300 --> 09:38.700
<b>Tomura Shigaraki?</b>

09:40.020 --> 09:42.970
<b>That person isn't here anymore.</b>

09:44.320 --> 09:49.230
<b>The two have melded completely 
into one being.</b>

09:51.740 --> 09:56.190
<b>But, perhaps because he's 
been alive longer,</b>

09:56.190 --> 09:58.900
<b>All For One is in charge.</b>

10:00.800 --> 10:04.400
<b>I don't know what you're thinking,</b>

10:05.030 --> 10:08.920
<b>but don't think you can make 
everything into your ideal,</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:11.830
<b>Izuku Midoriya.</b>

10:12.700 --> 10:15.630
<b>The two have melded completely 
into one being?</b>

10:16.190 --> 10:18.970
<b>That's not how it looked to me.</b>

10:19.490 --> 10:22.960
<b>When I made an insensitive remark earlier...</b>

10:23.620 --> 10:25.480
<b>I see.</b>

10:25.850 --> 10:28.560
<b>You didn't have any friends.</b>

10:30.650 --> 10:31.920
<b>I do have friends...</b>

10:34.080 --> 10:38.610
<b>Mikkun and Tomo said I was nice!</b>

10:38.610 --> 10:41.080
<b>Mon wanted to take walks with me!</b>

10:41.450 --> 10:45.030
<b>I do too have friends!</b>

10:46.000 --> 10:51.100
<b>He got really angry and distressed, 
like he was possessed.</b>

10:51.100 --> 10:53.430
<b>He was like a little kid.</b>

10:54.380 --> 10:59.420
<b>It really didn't look like 
they had completely melded.</b>

11:00.430 --> 11:04.140
<b>And after that, it seemed 
like the more he got hit,</b>

11:05.020 --> 11:07.910
<b>the more unstable he became.</b>

11:23.490 --> 11:24.680
<b>Izuku.</b>

11:29.360 --> 11:30.340
<b>He's...</b>

11:30.340 --> 11:31.500
<b>still...</b>

11:32.030 --> 11:32.790
<b>...there!</b>

11:40.220 --> 11:42.220
<b>Monoma! Don't look away!</b>

11:43.130 --> 11:44.650
<b>I don't care about you.</b>

11:45.200 --> 11:48.180
<b>I'll take my little brother back!</b>

11:55.100 --> 11:56.970
<b>You too!</b>

11:57.530 --> 12:00.820
<b>Don't think you can make everything 
into your ideal, either!</b>

12:04.190 --> 12:06.470
<b>Blackwhip with Fa Jin stored inside--</b>

12:06.470 --> 12:08.320
<b>A boosted binding combo!</b>

12:10.290 --> 12:11.990
<b>Blackchain!</b>

12:14.780 --> 12:16.350
<b>It doesn't matter if it's boosted or not.</b>

12:16.710 --> 12:18.220
<b>You can't use the same thing on me twi--</b>

12:21.640 --> 12:23.290
<b>Once you use it, it's over.</b>

12:23.780 --> 12:27.760
<b>If you don't defeat him within five 
minutes, the world will lose.</b>

12:29.280 --> 12:31.100
<b>I'll end this once and for all.</b>

12:32.470 --> 12:36.900
<b>Second's Transmission!</b>

12:43.020 --> 12:44.650
<b>Second Gear!</b>

12:46.030 --> 12:47.630
<b>Third Gear!</b>

12:49.110 --> 12:50.700
<b>Top Gear!</b>

12:57.580 --> 13:00.050
<b>The sound's coming later?</b>

13:02.410 --> 13:03.890
<b>What did he do to me?</b>

13:04.790 --> 13:06.170
<b>Where did he go?</b>

13:06.940 --> 13:09.880
<b>This is completely different from 
that glowing energy from earlier.</b>

13:09.880 --> 13:11.360
<b>He's too fast!</b>

13:12.230 --> 13:13.240
<b>Don't tell me...</b>

13:13.640 --> 13:16.550
<b>He has the meta ability that changes 
the speed of those he touches?</b>

13:17.280 --> 13:18.480
<b>Gearshift...</b>

13:20.030 --> 13:21.900
<b>Overdrive!</b>

13:22.920 --> 13:27.210
<b>It's different from when 
I used it, All For One.</b>

13:29.330 --> 13:35.680
<b>Right now, Izuku Midoriya is 
at 120% out of a hundred!</b>

13:37.150 --> 13:40.890
<b>Detroit Smash!</b>

13:45.070 --> 13:46.260
<b>Brother...</b>

13:48.260 --> 13:51.400
<b>Let's end this today.</b>

13:54.640 --> 13:57.020
<b>Izuku Midoriya</b>

14:03.020 --> 14:04.600
<b>That's strange.</b>

14:11.350 --> 14:12.700
<b>Why...?</b>

14:14.170 --> 14:20.630
<b>Your Quirk should only change 
the speed of what you touch.</b>

14:20.630 --> 14:23.830
<b>It should only work on small objects.</b>

14:27.170 --> 14:30.730
<b>Like peas in a tiny peashooter.</b>

14:31.530 --> 14:35.610
<b>It would've been laughable 
to call it a struggle.</b>

14:36.890 --> 14:39.570
<b>It was just the power of...</b>

14:40.430 --> 14:42.510
<b>...an insignificant beetle!</b>

14:43.280 --> 14:45.360
<b>That's all it was...</b>

14:50.610 --> 14:51.900
<b>Why...</b>

14:54.520 --> 14:56.720
<b>...can I see you people?!</b>

15:05.520 --> 15:06.790
<b>Not again!</b>

15:11.790 --> 15:13.090
<b>Midoriya...</b>

15:13.770 --> 15:14.940
<b>This is...</b>

15:17.110 --> 15:19.310
<b>Quirk: Gearshift.</b>

15:20.520 --> 15:23.130
<b>Like the meta abilities 
of the other successors,</b>

15:23.710 --> 15:28.880
<b>it has become stronger as 
One For All has grown.</b>

15:31.620 --> 15:35.310
<b>Gearshift, which originally 
only worked on small objects,</b>

15:35.310 --> 15:41.470
<b>has expanded to include the ability 
to work on objects cell by cell.</b>

15:42.790 --> 15:48.800
<b>And the pure power stored 
in One For All itself--</b>

15:49.440 --> 15:55.630
<b>When the two combine, this fist can 
even change the way the world works!</b>

15:59.440 --> 16:01.980
<b>Detroit Smash...</b>

16:04.020 --> 16:06.070
<b>Quintuple!</b>

16:11.510 --> 16:13.840
<b>It's not as strong as before.</b>

16:14.390 --> 16:18.360
<b>Likely because he hadn't 
stored that light in it.</b>

16:19.500 --> 16:21.300
<b>Even if I can't perceive it,</b>

16:21.300 --> 16:26.840
<b>from the trajectory of his attack, 
I can see the angle and timing</b>

16:29.790 --> 16:30.890
<b>he'll use next!</b>

16:35.930 --> 16:37.280
<b>Low Gear.</b>

16:38.070 --> 16:41.420
<b>Gearshift is a change in speed 
not dependent on inertia.</b>

16:42.450 --> 16:44.110
<b>All For One.</b>

16:45.250 --> 16:47.650
<b>You should know this.</b>

16:48.640 --> 16:50.810
<b>Then, at this rate--</b>

16:51.360 --> 16:53.440
<b>Sixth, Smokescreen!</b>

16:54.410 --> 16:55.530
<b>Useless--</b>

16:56.580 --> 16:57.620
<b>From above?!</b>

16:59.150 --> 17:02.280
<b>If he's been watching the 
timing of my movements,</b>

17:02.280 --> 17:03.960
<b>then I'll use Danger Sense 
to figure out where he is</b>

17:03.960 --> 17:06.980
<b>and Smokescreen to immediately 
block his field of vision.</b>

17:06.980 --> 17:09.420
<b>Then, use Float to move up quickly</b>

17:09.800 --> 17:12.260
<b>and catch him with Blackwhip 
when he's not watching.</b>

17:12.260 --> 17:13.920
<b>Draw him in all at once.</b>

17:14.350 --> 17:18.610
<b>Then, with the Fa Jin stored up 
during the Quintuple earlier,</b>

17:19.090 --> 17:23.010
<b>go into Gearshift: Overdrive again.</b>

17:24.320 --> 17:27.690
<b>I'll definitely use everything 
I've got this time!</b>

17:28.780 --> 17:32.060
<b>You're the one who will 
complete One For All!</b>

17:33.520 --> 17:36.610
<b>The meta ability isn't the part you 
should be paying attention to.</b>

17:38.760 --> 17:42.190
<b>What are you using what 
you have been given for?</b>

17:43.840 --> 17:46.260
<b>Who are you using it for?</b>

17:48.490 --> 17:50.380
<b>That strong will</b>

17:51.000 --> 17:53.170
<b>is what power lives in.</b>

17:57.490 --> 18:01.750
<b>That's why people call them Quirks.</b>

18:05.800 --> 18:07.840
<b>All For One!</b>

18:08.120 --> 18:09.550
<b>Shut up!</b>

18:10.030 --> 18:11.580
<b>I won't let you...</b>

18:21.490 --> 18:25.000
<b>You insects!</b>

18:25.000 --> 18:28.170
<b>...hurt anyone else!</b>

19:10.250 --> 19:12.050
<b>We're responding to each other...</b>

19:13.310 --> 19:16.690
<b>One For All to All For One...</b>

19:17.250 --> 19:20.610
<b>All For One to One For All...</b>

19:22.490 --> 19:23.600
<b>I can see...</b>

19:24.190 --> 19:26.890
<b>I can see my brother.</b>

19:28.590 --> 19:31.620
<b>The two have melded completely 
into one being?</b>

19:32.080 --> 19:35.160
<b>That's not how it looked to me.</b>

19:36.160 --> 19:40.650
<b>What the young man with the 
round eyes said is correct.</b>

19:41.470 --> 19:43.540
<b>All the fighting until now...</b>

19:44.050 --> 19:46.640
<b>The series of events that happened 
to get to this point...</b>

19:47.240 --> 19:50.160
<b>...has been shaking the 
balance of their union.</b>

19:51.490 --> 19:53.670
<b>It starts now, kid.</b>

19:54.530 --> 19:56.960
<b>Don't forget what Shimura said.</b>

19:59.860 --> 20:05.560
<b>If someone who looks like he's asking to 
be saved is someone who is irredeemable,</b>

20:06.080 --> 20:07.230
<b>do you...</b>

20:08.280 --> 20:11.700
<b>have the resolve to stop him, 
even if you have to kill him?</b>

20:12.580 --> 20:15.890
<b>It might be that the only way 
to stop him is to kill him.</b>

20:16.380 --> 20:19.900
<b>I don't know what I should do 
specifically yet either, but...</b>

20:22.430 --> 20:24.760
<b>I want to save that kid.</b>

20:25.960 --> 20:27.960
<b>Don't forget your own will.</b>

20:28.660 --> 20:31.230
<b>You can't be defeated yet.</b>

20:33.210 --> 20:35.460
<b>Use everything you've got?</b>

20:35.910 --> 20:37.250
<b>Quirks?</b>

20:37.740 --> 20:39.470
<b>Are you trying to make a fool out of me?</b>

20:40.120 --> 20:43.050
<b>I haven't used a single Quirk yet.</b>

20:43.530 --> 20:47.120
<b>I haven't shown you the true 
power of this body yet.</b>

20:48.220 --> 20:50.130
<b>It's their fault.</b>

20:50.800 --> 20:55.310
<b>Wretched and unseemly, Eraser 
Head and those kids.</b>

20:56.460 --> 20:58.550
<b>It's the fault of this coffin.</b>

20:58.980 --> 21:01.570
<b>This makeshift trick they 
used as a stopgap...</b>

21:01.570 --> 21:02.970
<b>Splitting us up...</b>

21:05.500 --> 21:07.640
<b>The series of events</b>

21:08.230 --> 21:10.100
<b>that led to this...</b>

21:15.110 --> 21:17.600
<b>There's still something...</b>

21:19.350 --> 21:21.030
<b>Not yet!</b>

21:23.860 --> 21:27.420
<b>Oh, my dear little brother, Yoichi!</b>

21:29.080 --> 21:32.690
<b>The series of events that led to this...</b>

21:33.480 --> 21:36.540
<b>If that's what will decide 
the victor and the loser...</b>

21:38.700 --> 21:41.590
<b>Then I...</b>

21:43.900 --> 21:46.710
<b>I still have a chance of winning!</b>

23:20.000 --> 23:22.000
<b>Preview</b>

23:21.110 --> 23:22.540
<b>Here's the preview.</b>

23:23.210 --> 23:27.910
<b>Two heteromorphs are divided as a hero 
and a villain and fight each other.</b>

23:28.320 --> 23:32.980
<b>One uses violence to try and clear his 
feelings of hatred from being oppressed.</b>

23:32.980 --> 23:37.130
<b>The other continues to be cheerfully 
hopeful even in the midst of everything.</b>

23:38.170 --> 23:40.550
<b>Next time, "Together with Shoji."</b>

23:41.320 --> 23:45.970
<b>Shoji, Koda, you two are true heroes!</b>

23:45.980 --> 23:49.980
<b>Next time: Together with Shoji</b>

23:46.380 --> 23:48.040
<b>Go beyond!</b>

23:48.040 --> 23:49.490
<b>Plus Ultra!</b>
